// Coverage: dense/tight spacing with many accidentals — a chromatic 16th run
// then chord clusters with stacked sharps/flats. Stresses accidental placement
// and spacing reservation under tight (short-duration) columns.
title "Dense chromatic / tight spacing"
time 4/4
key c major
part m { clef treble }
section Main {
  m {
    cis16 d dis e f fis g gis a ais b c |
    <cis e gis>8 <d f aes> <ees ges bes> <e g b> r2 |
  }
}
structure { Main }
score "dense-chromatic" { staff { m } }
